  "extra": {
    "note": "EcomCraft Turbo image-edit blueprint (T118b, F84/F86), adapted from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates image_qwen_image_2_1_turbo_image_edit.json (MIT license). Changes: removed MarkdownNote, ImageCompare, the example LoadImage and the prompt-enhancement chain (TextGenerate and its ComfySwitchNode, disabled in the official file and unused here); UNETLoader replaced by UnetLoaderGGUF (the file name is filled from the current recipe's variant at publish time; an int8 safetensors variant swaps the loader to UNETLoader); the official sampling path is kept exactly: SamplerCustomAdvanced with RandomNoise, CFGGuider (cfg 1), KSamplerSelect (euler) and ManualSigmas carrying the fixed 8-step sigma table 1.0, 0.978453, 0.95418, 0.926626, 0.89508, 0.845148, 0.704534, 0.414568, 0; the model patch is QwenImage21Cache (device auto, dtype default); no shift / ModelSamplingAuraFlow node. TextEncodeQwenImage21 resolution stays 0 (the canvas follows image_1) and custom_size stays off, so the latent comes from the encoder; the official edit template's stored CFGGuider cfg 8 is not carried over, the subgraph's cfg 1 (what actually runs) is used instead."
  },
  "version": 0.4
}
